# EPIC-010 — Legendary Product

Full spec: `docs/EPIC-010.md`

Build what people **recommend without being asked** — not what ships fastest.

## Core question

*What makes someone tell a friend about this app?* — not *what can we add?*

## Legend test (feature must hit ≥1)

Wonder · Comfort · Reflection · Beauty · Trust · Memorability

**None → remove or simplify.**

## Six-month memory to protect

> *A quiet place where I paused, drew something meaningful, and left a note to myself.*

Reveal · Journal · Threshold — everything else secondary.

## Why users keep ORACLY

Real journal memory × Trust × Place feeling

## Never optimize for

Screenshots · First impression only · Feature count · Streaks · Viral gimmicks

## Always optimize for

Sessions · Long-term affection · Timeless craft · Honest ritual

## Final question

Will this help someone quietly recommend ORACLY for peaceful minutes they genuinely value?

If not — it doesn't belong.
